{| cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" border="1" |- | colspan="2" style="text-align: center; background-color: #D0D0D0; "' | '''Process Purchase Order Acknowledgement''' |- ! Document Number From | The first document number that you'd like to be in your range of orders to process. |- ! Document Number To |The last document number that you'd like to be in your range of orders to process. |- ! Date From | The first date that you'd like to be in your range of orders to process. |- ! Date To |The last date that you'd like to be in your range of orders to process. |}

