{| cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" border="1" |- | colspan="2" style="text-align: center; background-color: #D0D0D0; " | '''Labeling Settings''' |- ! Page Size | This field is to set your label page size(Labels are split into batches of maximum of 100 labels per PDF). |- ! Days of recent label logs to keep | This field is to set the number of days to log within. The logs which are out of date will be deleted in the next label printing. |- ! Label Log Tracing | This field is to set if you want to have Label Tracing Log On or Off. |- ! Next GS1-128 # | This is the Next GS1-128 number generated by Extension, Company # and Next Serial #. |- ! Extension | The extension number of the GS1-128. |- ! Company # | The company number of the GS1-128. |- ! Next Serial # | The next serial number of the GS1-128. |- ! Generate GS1-128 Auto-Create | An option that control if you need to auto-generate the GS1-128. |}

